5. Credits retained from the upstream project
--------------------------------------------

  * Brand: the lowercase "owntv" wordmark was designed for OwnTV by
    @m3th0d93 (https://github.com/m3th0d93) in issue #227
    (https://github.com/ahXN00/OwnTV/issues/227). The МОЁ ТВ brand kit in
    extras/brand/ (generators in extras/branding/) is this fork's own work;
    the original artwork is retained in extras/brand/legacy/.
  * Translations: upstream shipped 26 locales from OwnTV_Core. The English
    source strings and the Russian translation are the two still packaged
    here; the other trees were removed from this fork (baa3d2b) and remain
    available in the upstream repository. Most of those translations were
    contributed by volunteer translators on Hosted Weblate
    (https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/owntv/), which hosts libre projects
    free of charge. Thank you to Weblate and to every translator.
  * TMDB: upstream OwnTV used the TMDB API (https://www.themoviedb.org/)
    for movie/series metadata and trailers. This fork removed that
    integration and the upstream reference Worker, so no TMDB API is called;
    the name is kept only to describe the upstream origin.
  * OpenSubtitles: upstream OwnTV used the OpenSubtitles API
    (https://www.opensubtitles.com/) for subtitle search. This fork removed
    that integration, the reference Worker and the bundled logo, so no
    OpenSubtitles API is called; the name is kept only to describe the
    upstream origin.
  * mpv / libmpv / FFmpeg: these were part of upstream OwnTV but are NO
    LONGER SHIPPED by this fork (removed in commits ac5cc39 and 933cc94).
    The historical credits are preserved in CHANGELOG.md; no mpv/FFmpeg
    binaries or sources are distributed here.
  * Community contributions credited in CHANGELOG.md (PR numbers, @handles)
    belong to the upstream project's history, not to this fork.


